    "narrative": "Crashed following explosion of a device placed in the cargo hold. \nTraces of Nitro-glycerine found on wreckage parts led the investigators to the conclusion that an explosive device was probably placed on board at Newark NJ. The perpetrator/s were never found.\n\n\nAccident investigation:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n\nReport\u00a0number:\u00a0\n \n\n\nStatus: \nInvestigation completed\n\n\nDuration: \n\n\nDownload report: \n \n \nFinal report",
    "asn_url": "https://aviation-safety.net/wikibase/34169"
  },
