    "location": "Beni Suef",
    "category": "",
    "fatalities": 6,
    "narrative": "The Boeing 707 took off from Cairo (CAI) at 14:34 on a training flight. The airplane crashed along Airway A1C probably following a separation of the no. 4 engine and pylon.",
